<script setup lang="ts">import {ref,computed,onMounted,onUnmounted,watch} from 'vue';import {route} from '../router';import {runs} from '../stores/runs';import {reviews} from '../stores/reviews';import {canWrite} from '../stores/auth';import {useTask} from '../hooks/useTask';import {fixed,pct} from '../utils/format';import PageHeading from '../components/common/PageHeading.vue';import StatusPill from '../components/common/StatusPill.vue';import Notice from '../components/common/Notice.vue';import EmptyState from '../components/common/EmptyState.vue';import BlendMetrics from '../components/BlendMetrics.vue';import RecipeBars from '../components/RecipeBars.vue';import QualityTable from '../components/QualityTable.vue';import SampleCloud from '../components/SampleCloud.vue';const selected=ref(route.value.query.get('run')||'demo-run'),action=ref('核查名义配方约束余量与固定配方LHS通过数；线性混合与独立均匀扰动只作模拟假设，不据此直接认证工业质量。'),notice=ref('');watch(()=>route.value.query.get('run'),v=>{selected.value=v||'demo-run'});const {error,busy,act}=useTask();let timer:ReturnType<typeof setInterval>;onMounted(()=>{runs.load();timer=setInterval(runs.load,2000)});onUnmounted(()=>clearInterval(timer));const run=computed(()=>runs.items.value.find(r=>r.id===selected.value)),result=computed(()=>run.value?.result);
const recovered=computed(()=>Number(run.value?.attempts||0)>1);
const snapshot=computed(()=>result.value?.input_snapshot||run.value?.input_snapshot||null);
const fmtTime=(v:string|null|undefined)=>!v?'—':new Date(v.endsWith('Z')?v:v+'Z').toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false});
function submit(){act(async()=>{await reviews.create({run_id:selected.value,action:action.value});notice.value='配方复核已提交，等待管理员批准。'})}</script>
<template><PageHeading index="04 / 运行底稿" title="看名义约束，也看固定配方的失败样本。" note="求解器只优化名义参数一次，LHS样本只重新评价固定比例。不可行没有配方，也没有伪造的模拟结果。"/><div class="result-toolbar"><label>运行记录<select v-model="selected"><option v-for="r in runs.items.value" :key="r.id" :value="r.id">{{r.id==='demo-run'?'八原浆基线':r.id.slice(0,8)}} · {{r.status}}</option></select></label><StatusPill v-if="run" :status="run.status"/></div>
<Notice v-if="recovered" hint="" :message="`该试算经历过中断恢复，共尝试 ${run?.attempts} 次后完成；结果只按建单时固化的原浆、规格与抽样设置重算，未混入后续改动。`"/>
<Notice v-if="run&&run.status==='running'&&recovered" hint="" :message="`worker 已接管中断前的第 ${run.attempts} 次计算，正在沿用最初设置恢复，无需重新投递。`"/>
<section v-if="run" class="recovery-panel"><h2>恢复与输入快照</h2><dl><div><dt>尝试次数</dt><dd>{{run.attempts||1}}{{recovered?'（含中断接管）':''}}</dd></div><div><dt>开始/完成</dt><dd>{{fmtTime(run.started_at)}} / {{fmtTime(run.finished_at)}}</dd></div><template v-if="snapshot"><div><dt>固化原浆批次</dt><dd>{{snapshot.dataset_name}}</dd></div><div><dt>固化质量窗口</dt><dd>{{snapshot.spec_name}}</dd></div><div><dt>抽样设置</dt><dd>LHS {{snapshot.n_samples}} · seed {{snapshot.seed}} · 成本{{snapshot.perturb_cost?'扰动':'固定'}}</dd></div></template></dl><p class="method-note">恢复计算只读取建单时固化的输入快照；之后对原浆、规格或情景的修改不影响本试算，已完成试算与归档保持原样。</p></section>
<Notice :message="error||runs.error.value"/><Notice v-if="run?.status==='failed'" :message="run.error"/><Notice v-if="run?.status==='infeasible'" :message="result.lp.reason"/><EmptyState v-if="run&&['queued','running'].includes(run.status)" text="后台worker正在求名义配方并评价固定比例的LHS扰动，每两秒刷新。中断后会由可用worker自动接管，重复投递不会再算一遍。"/><template v-if="run?.status==='completed'&&result"><BlendMetrics :result="result"/><div class="formula-overview"><section><h2>名义配方比例</h2><RecipeBars :rows="result.lp.shares"/></section><section><h2>固定配方扰动分布</h2><SampleCloud :result="result"/><QualityTable :rows="result.lp.qualities"/><p class="method-note">{{result.robustness.assumption}}</p><p class="method-note">边界比较绝对容差 {{result.robustness.comparison_tolerance}}（各属性自身单位）；成本{{result.robustness.perturb_cost?'独立均匀扰动':'固定'}}，LHS {{result.robustness.dimension_count}}维，seed={{result.robustness.seed}}；零宽度维变换后为常量。</p></section></div><div class="result-columns"><section><h2>扰动样本预览</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>序号</th><th>强度</th><th>白度</th><th>回收率</th><th>成本</th><th>全部合规</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="s in result.robustness.samples.slice(0,16)" :key="s.index"><td>{{s.index}}</td><td>{{fixed(s.strength)}}</td><td>{{fixed(s.whiteness)}}</td><td>{{pct(s.recycled)}}</td><td>{{fixed(s.cost)}}</td><td>{{s.compliant?'是':'否'}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><form v-if="canWrite()" class="editor-panel" @submit.prevent="submit"><h2>提交配方复核</h2><label>复核说明<textarea v-model="action" required minlength="8" rows="7"></textarea></label><button :disabled="busy">提交配方复核</button><p class="success" v-if="notice">{{notice}}</p></form></div></template></template>
